[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p>1. Undo retaining bolts</p><p>2. Remove the rear safety belt.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The procedure describes the removal\nof the right rear seat belt; to remove the left rear seat belt, carry\nout the same operations.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047311.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the reel in position\nand tighten the fixing bolt to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT REEL.</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The procedure describes the refitting\nof the right rear seat belt;  to refit the left rear seat belt,\ncarry out the same operations.</p></aside>"]]